":"","verse_key":"44:38"}]},{"verse_key":"44:39","surah":44,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"مَا خَلَقْنَـٰهُمَآ إِلَّا بِٱلْحَقِّ وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We created them for a true purpose, but most people do not comprehend.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"44:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَلَقْنَـٰهُمَآ","en_gloss":"We created both of them","transliteration":"khalaqnāhumā","verse_key":"44:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"44:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"in [the] truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"44:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"44:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","en_gloss":"most of them","transliteration":"aktharahum","verse_key":"44:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"44:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"44:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٣٩","en_gloss":"(39)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"44:39"}]}]}